WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.357
Several ablations sharpen the picture.

00:00:02.437 --> 00:00:06.846
Changing the prompt background color changes the
generated background,

00:00:06.926 --> 00:00:13.260
and using black-background prompts makes a simple
grayscale-threshold post-processing step reliable.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:19.160
Training without shuffling the task data triggers
catastrophic forgetting: the model becomes

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.174
proficient only on its most recently seen task,

00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:26.151
with perplexity on earlier tasks exploding into the
thousands,

00:00:26.231 --> 00:00:30.640
underscoring that shuffling is essential for
multi-task LVMs. Finally,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.141
even at just eighty million parameters,

00:00:33.221 --> 00:00:38.272
knowledge distillation still improves validation
perplexity across segmentation,

00:00:38.352 --> 00:00:40.260
pose estimation, and deraining.
